Subject: [PATCH] preserve original emission source and native borrowed address words

Upstream-base: 0f5a757947b8778b680d4d1ae7e6df1792a514f2

Restore literal controller/manager decisions, preserve retail numeric word
overflow, and transport genuine native pointer/callback bits without truncation.
Native replay uses the native process POD ABI; persisted/Wii replay relocation
remains unqualified. No extra game ownership, requests or readiness is introduced.

